// The protobuf schema this page decodes and encodes with.
//
// A protobuf.js `Root.fromJSON` document, built at generation time from the
// descriptor set protoc produces for this interface's .proto sources, together
// with any well-known types the interface names.  The browser needs a schema to
// read protobuf bytes at all, and shipping it as data keeps the page free of a
// build step.
//
// Field names are spelled as the .proto file spells them, so a field is called
// the same thing here as in the Python, Rust and C++ output.
window.STINGER_PROTO = {{ utils.protobufjs_bundle() }};
